<title>USA: S &amp; K Famous Feb same-store sales up 7pct.</title>
<headline>S &amp; K Famous Feb same-store sales up 7pct.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $8.9	 $8.3	   +16	 +7</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Total sales percent change is net of the volume in the three former Mega Centers closed or sold in 1996.</p>
<p>Month is  four  weeks ended February 22  .</p>
<p>Full company name is S &amp; K Famous Brands Inc.</p>
</text>
